---
title: Instant Pot Quinoa
source: https://www.skinnytaste.com/how-to-make-perfect-quinoa-in-the-instant-pot/
---

Rinse the @quinoa{2/3 to 1%cup} under cold running water to remove the bitter coating.

Add quinoa and @water or broth{1 to 1-1/2%cups} to the #instant pot{}. Use a 1:1.5 ratio of quinoa to liquid.

Pressure cook for ~{2%minutes} on high, then natural release for ~{10%minutes}.

Fluff with a fork before serving.
